      "tier": 1,
      "title": "副本模式并不会关掉 CHECK、唯一约束和行级安全",
      "summary": "Seedfast 的 Mikhail Shytsko 在 PostgreSQL 18.6 与 19beta3 上逐项验证 session_replication_role = replica：外键、ON DELETE CASCADE、规则和事件触发器确实静默，标记 ENABLE REPLICA 的触发器反而开始触发，而 CHECK、NOT NULL、唯一约束和行级安全照常拦截。恢复时只有 NOT ENFORCED 切回会扫表。",
      "url": "https://seedfa.st/blog/session-replication-role",
      "author": "Mikhail Shytsko",
      "source": "Seedfast 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-09-04",
      "image": "https://seedfa.st/blog/session-replication-role-1.svg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "约束",
        "逻辑复制",
        "触发器"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 的外键快速路径会漏掉外键检查",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 新的外键快速路径批处理层被查出两个缺陷：在 AFTER 触发器里执行 ALTER TABLE ... ADD FOREIGN KEY 时，验证检查被错误并入外层批次，外键检查因此被跳过，孤立行会当作合法数据提交；SET CONSTRAINTS ... IMMEDIATE 启动嵌套触发周期时则触发断言崩溃并漏检。两个补丁已就绪，要等批处理层是否从 19 回退有结论才推送。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CA+HiwqGeBaJ5eXnkYHHQUBqZAZyihc=TqseB-VQTY5_sEvd_Zg@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source": "PostgreSQL 邮件列表",
      "source_date": "2026-09-04",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PG19",
        "外键",
        "数据正确性"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "postgres_fdw 对分区外表批量更新会造成数据损坏",
      "summary": "Ajit Awekar 的补丁修复了 2018 年就已知的缺陷：通过 postgres_fdw 对分区外表批量 DELETE/UPDATE 会造成数据逻辑损坏。Jakub Wartak 审查后指出代价不小：补丁用 ROW() 和列名各传一次数据，所有 postgres_fdw 外表的 CPU 开销约翻倍；逐行发出的语句无法按 tableoid 做分区裁剪，性能随行数与分区数之积恶化。部分问题还没有明确方案。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAKZiRmw1ZeHp2=jg8psZ8gm+ehLx2KoN4Hxj0XhJ_5HaugFvsA@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Ajit Awekar",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-09-04",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "postgres_fdw",
        "分区",
        "数据正确性"
      ],
      "position": 3
